<title>FINLAND: FINNISH MAY FOREIGN TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT 1000.</title>
<headline>FINNISH MAY FOREIGN TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT 1000.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary foreign trade data for May is due today at 1000/0700 GMT, the national customs board said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
